      <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation mr-1"></i>
      Browser Anda tidak mendukung fitur Web Speech API (Text-to-Speech). Seluruh materi teks dan ilustrasi tetap dapat digunakan sepenuhnya.
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- FLOATING GLOBAL AUDIO CONTROLLER BAR (Appears when SpeechSynthesis is active) -->
  <div id="floating-audio-bar" class="hidden fixed bottom-16 sm:bottom-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-40 bg-navy-900/95 backdrop-blur-md text-white border-2 border-amber-400 shadow-2xl rounded-2xl px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-3 max-w-md w-[92%]">
    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse shrink-0">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-waveform-lines fa-volume-high"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
      <div id="audio-now-playing-title" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 truncate">Audio Narrator</div>
      <div id="audio-now-playing-status" class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 truncate">Membacakan teks...</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
